            "Yes, because exculpatory agreements in recreational sporting facilities are conclusive and unreviewable by courts.",
            "No, because the failure to construct lane partitions to industry safety standards is an enhanced risk created by the owner's negligence, rather than an inherent risk of the sport of archery.",
            "No, because all liability waivers required as a condition of entering commercial sports facilities are void as against public policy."
